{
  "as_of": "2026-09-27",
  "scope": "DNS cache lifetime and result admission when lookup completion races with cancellation or a deadline. Controlled resolver and testing/synctest virtual time; no live remote DNS exploit or deployment test.",
  "changes": [
    "Anchor both upstream TTL and the local twice-refresh-interval cap to lookup start; never add a previously calculated remaining lifetime to a later clock sample.",
    "Before accepting returned addresses, inspect lookup context error and require completion strictly before its absolute deadline, including an earlier parent deadline.",
    "Canceled, expired, late or failed results replace the previous cache entry with failure; a later independent timely refresh can recover."
  ],
